# TypeScript app
# No trailing slash: a bare name also matches a symlink, which a directory
# pattern does not. A node_modules symlink created inside a scratch worktree
# has been committed here before.
node_modules
/dist/
# `bun build --compile` leaves one of these behind in the repo root when a
# compile fails, which is exactly when someone is most likely to `git add -A`.
*.bun-build
